# TMDB Movies Data Analysis

This project focuses on analyzing movie data from the TMDB dataset to explore movie budgets, revenues, ratings, and genres.

The project uses Python for data cleaning and preparation, PostgreSQL for database management and SQL analysis, and Power BI for data modeling and dashboard development.

The dashboard provides insights into movie financial performance, audience ratings, and trends across different movie genres and years.

**Tools Used:** Python, Pandas, PostgreSQL, SQL, Power BI, DAX.
